---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "@/components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "@/components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="4340行AI抗衰候选公开预测表｜中文搜索与原始数据"
  description="免登录搜索和排序2023年研究公开的4340行预测分数，核对P>0.44的21个实验候选；提供原始CSV、许可与论文，不提供用药建议。"
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main-content" class="app-layout mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-10">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">
      把视频里的公开预测表，自己查一遍
    </h1>
    <p class="text-base-content/70 mt-5 leading-7">
      这是 Smer-Barreto 等人 2023 年研究已经计算好的 4340 行预测分数。
      本页只增加中文搜索、排序与筛选，<strong>没有重新训练或运行AI模型</strong
      >。 适合想核对视频数字、阅读论文和学习数据处理的读者。
    </p>
    <aside class="mt-6 border-l-4 border-accent bg-accent/5 p-4 leading-7">
      <strong>分数不是人体有效率，也不是用药清单。</strong>
      本研究按 P&gt;0.44 选择 21 个化合物做实验，3 个在培养细胞中表现出所研究的活性；
      不能据此推断人体延寿、安全性或剂量。不要据此自行购买或试用化合物。
    </aside>

    <section
      aria-labelledby="explorer-heading"
      class="mt-8 border-y border-border py-6"
    >
      <h2 id="explorer-heading" class="text-xl font-semibold">
        先搜一个名称，或比较分数顺序
      </h2>
      <div class="mt-5 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto]">
        <div>
          <label for="score-query" class="block font-semibold">公开名称</label>
          <input
            id="score-query"
            type="search"
            maxlength="120"
            autocomplete="off"
            spellcheck="false"
            placeholder="例如 Ginkgetin"
            disabled
            class="bg-base-100 mt-2 w-full rounded-lg border border-border px-4 py-3"
          />
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="score-order" class="block font-semibold">排序方式</label>
          <select
            id="score-order"
            disabled
            class="bg-base-100 mt-2 w-full rounded-lg border border-border px-4 py-3"
          >
            <option value="desc">分数从高到低</option>
            <option value="asc">分数从低到高</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
        <button
          id="score-example"
          type="button"
          disabled
          class="rounded-lg border border-border px-3 py-2">查视频示例</button
        >
        <button
          id="score-reset"
          type="button"
          disabled
          class="rounded-lg border border-border px-3 py-2">清空并重置</button
        >
        <label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm">
          <input id="score-selected" type="checkbox" disabled />
          只看研究阈值 P&gt;0.44
        </label>
      </div>
      <p
        id="score-status"
        class="mt-5 text-sm"
        role="status"
        aria-live="polite"
      >
        正在读取并核对原始CSV…
      </p>
      <noscript
        ><p class="mt-4">
          浏览器未启用JavaScript。请用下方链接下载原始CSV，在表格软件里查看。
        </p></noscript
      >
      <div
        class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto"
        tabindex="0"
        role="region"
        aria-label="公开分数表，可横向滚动"
      >
        <table class="w-full border-collapse text-left text-sm">
          <caption class="sr-only"
            >作者公开计算结果，不是本网站的预测或医学建议</caption
          >
          <thead
            ><tr class="border-b border-border">
              <th scope="col" class="p-3">原CSV行</th>
              <th scope="col" class="p-3">公开名称</th>
              <th scope="col" class="p-3">分数 probability</th>
            </tr></thead
          >
          <tbody id="score-rows"></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
        <button
          id="score-prev"
          type="button"
          disabled
          class="rounded-lg border border-border px-3 py-2">上一页</button
        >
        <span id="score-page" class="text-sm">尚未加载</span>
        <button
          id="score-next"
          type="button"
          disabled
          class="rounded-lg border border-border px-3 py-2">下一页</button
        >
      </div>
      <p class="text-base-content/60 mt-4 text-sm leading-6">
        搜索与筛选只在本页运行，不提交搜索文字、不接收健康资料。站点保留既有页面访问统计，
        不把本次自测计作真实用户需求。原CSV行是数据行号，不含表头；显示分数保留原数值，不转成百分比疗效。
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-8 leading-7" aria-labelledby="download-heading">
      <h2 id="download-heading" class="text-xl font-semibold">
        拿走原数据，继续核对
      </h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-3 pl-5">
        <li>
          <a
            class="text-accent underline"
            href="/data/senolytics-2023/xgboost_prediction_scores.csv"
            download>下载未经修改的原始CSV（约197KB）</a
          >：用 Excel、LibreOffice 或代码打开，按 probability 降序排列。
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            class="text-accent underline"
            href="/data/senolytics-2023/offline-viewer-corrected-20261106.zip"
            download>下载中文离线查看包（约197KB）</a
          >：解压后双击HTML，不需要安装Python或填写Key。
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            class="text-accent underline"
            href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-023-39120-1"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">读原论文</a
          >：从 Fig.2d、Fig.3c 与 Methods
          核对筛选阈值和实验设计；本页没有逐项标注21个候选的实验结果。
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-4">
        配套视频：<a
          class="text-accent underline"
          href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Rc4e69EUE"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer">为什么还得看另一组细胞？</a
        >
        · <a
          class="text-accent underline"
          href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Pw4Y6NEew"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer">打开4340行打分表</a
        >。 表打不开或有解释错误？<a
          class="text-accent underline"
          href="https://github.com/dongyu19920904/BioAI-Content-Hub/issues/new/choose"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer">反馈具体步骤</a
        >，不要上传体检单或其他个人健康资料。
      </p>
    </section>
    <section
      class="mt-8 border-t border-border pt-6 text-sm leading-6"
      aria-labelledby="source-heading"
    >
      <h2 id="source-heading" class="text-lg font-semibold">
        来源、许可与可复核指纹
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-3">
        数据：Smer-Barreto, Vanessa; Quintanilla, Andrea; Elliot, Richard J. R.;
        Dawson, John C.; Sun, Jiugeng; Lorente-Macías, Álvaro; Unciti-Broceta,
        Asier; Carragher, Neil O.; Acosta, Juan Carlos; Oyarzún, Diego A.
        (2023).
        <a
          class="text-accent underline"
          href="https://zenodo.org/records/7870357"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >Code and data for “Discovery of senolytics using machine learning”,
          v1</a
        >，DOI 10.5281/zenodo.7870357，
        <a
          class="text-accent underline"
          href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer">CC BY 4.0</a
        >。
        修改范围：增加中文展示、搜索、排序与阈值筛选；原CSV字节未改。许可与来源于2026-11-06核对。
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 font-mono break-all">
        SHA256：8b70fa4a3f0047bf63346ee32a64faf812b74b6daf4b458add728af36b53e86d
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3">
        <a
          class="text-accent underline"
          href="https://github.com/dongyu19920904/BioAI-Content-Hub/blob/main/src/pages/projects/senolytics-prediction-table.astro"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer">本页开源代码</a
        > · <a
          class="text-accent underline"
          href="/data/senolytics-2023/README.txt">数据说明</a
        > · <a class="text-accent underline" href="/projects/">返回工具入口</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<script>
  import {
    parseScores,
    selectScores,
    SCORE_SHA256,
  } from "@/scripts/senolyticsExplorer.mjs";

  function mountExplorer() {
    const status = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#score-status");
    const query = document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>("#score-query");
    const order = document.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>("#score-order");
    const selected =
      document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>("#score-selected");
    const body = document.querySelector<HTMLTableSectionElement>("#score-rows");
    const label = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#score-page");
    const previous = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>("#score-prev");
    const next = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>("#score-next");
    const example = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>("#score-example");
    const reset = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>("#score-reset");
    if (
      !status ||
      !query ||
      !order ||
      !selected ||
      !body ||
      !label ||
      !previous ||
      !next ||
      !example ||
      !reset ||
      status.dataset.mounted
    )
      return;
    status.dataset.mounted = "true";
    let rows: ReturnType<typeof parseScores> = [],
      page = 0;
    function render() {
      const result = selectScores(rows, {
        query: query!.value,
        ascending: order!.value === "asc",
        selectedOnly: selected!.checked,
        page,
      });
      page = result.page;
      body!.replaceChildren();
      for (const row of result.items) {
        const tr = document.createElement("tr");
        tr.className = "border-b border-border";
        for (const value of [row.row, row.name, row.score]) {
          const td = document.createElement("td");
          td.className = "p-3 break-words";
          td.textContent = String(value);
          tr.append(td);
        }
        body!.append(tr);
      }
      status!.textContent = result.total
        ? `共 ${result.total} 行 · 原始表 4340 行${selected!.checked ? " · 研究阈值筛选，不代表人体有效" : ""}`
        : "没有匹配名称，试试清空搜索。";
      label!.textContent = `${page + 1} / ${result.pages} 页`;
      previous!.disabled = page === 0;
      next!.disabled = page >= result.pages - 1;
    }
    const restart = () => {
      page = 0;
      render();
    };
    query.oninput = restart;
    order.onchange = restart;
    selected.onchange = restart;
    previous.onclick = () => {
      page--;
      render();
    };
    next.onclick = () => {
      page++;
      render();
    };
    example.onclick = () => {
      query.value = "Ginkgetin";
      restart();
    };
    reset.onclick = () => {
      query.value = "";
      order.value = "desc";
      selected.checked = false;
      restart();
    };
    void (async () => {
      try {
        const response = await fetch(
          "/data/senolytics-2023/xgboost_prediction_scores.csv",
          { credentials: "omit" }
        );
        if (!response.ok) throw new Error("CSV请求失败");
        const bytes = await response.arrayBuffer();
        const digest = await crypto.subtle.digest("SHA-256", bytes);
        const hash = [...new Uint8Array(digest)]
          .map(byte => byte.toString(16).padStart(2, "0"))
          .join("");
        if (hash !== SCORE_SHA256) throw new Error("CSV指纹不符");
        rows = parseScores(
          new TextDecoder("utf-8", { fatal: true }).decode(bytes)
        );
        if (
          rows.length !== 4340 ||
          selectScores(rows, { selectedOnly: true }).total !== 21
        )
          throw new Error("CSV行数异常");
        for (const control of [query, order, selected, example, reset])
          control.disabled = false;
        render();
      } catch {
        status.textContent =
          "公开表未能通过加载或指纹核对，筛选保持关闭。请下载原始CSV或离线包，也可反馈错误。";
      }
    })();
  }
  mountExplorer();
  document.addEventListener("astro:page-load", mountExplorer);
</script>

<style>
  button,
  select {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  button:disabled,
  input:disabled,
  select:disabled {
    opacity: 0.55;
  }
  button:not(:disabled):hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
  button:focus-visible,
  input:focus-visible,
  select:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }
  td:nth-child(2) {
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
</style>
